A YAML-1.1 boolean word is quoted so it reloads as the string it was written as.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
---

# Foo

Body paragraph.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md summary=yes
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 ---
 title: Foo
+summary: 'yes'
 ---
 
 # Foo
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: summary=yes
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
summary: 'yes'
---

# Foo

Body paragraph.
